    "diagnosis": "Pilocytic astrocytoma ",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Rosenthal fibres and eosinophilic granular bodies. Typically, Rosenthal fibres are more abundant than eosinophilic granular bodies in pilocytic astrocytomas, but both can be observed, as in this case.",
